      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TALTARNI DAISY (2) won again in another strong performance after leading to make it two in a row at this track over 425m (24.37). Got the money at her only try from this box. The hardest to beat again. TALTARNI BLUE (7) turned in a modest effort most recently when seventh at Ballarat over 450m behind Little Amigo (26.18) in a Mix 6/7. Was a winner prior to that. The form out of her last race has been franked. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. BLACKBERRY JUICE (6) ran a good time (28.58) when placing three back at this track but has missed the frame since, last time out finishing eighth (25.41) at this track. Can turn it around this time. SAINT FRANKLIN (8) placed last time as favourite - worth some thought.",
